{"version":1,"unit":"degree","description":"Joint rotation limits for VRM humanoid normalized bones. Intended to be engine-agnostic: any consumer only needs the frame, the Euler order and the per-axis ranges.","frame":"VRM normalized humanoid rig in T-pose (three-vrm getNormalizedBoneNode, after VRMUtils.rotateVRM0). Right-handed, +Y up, character faces +Z, character's LEFT is +X. All bones have identity rotation in T-pose, so each bone's local axes equal the world axes. Values are the bone's local rotation relative to that rest pose.","eulerOrder":"Each bone has an 'order' (three.js Euler order, R = product left-to-right e.g. ZYX = Rz*Ry*Rx). The order is chosen so that the LAST letter is the bone's long axis (twist), applied first, and the singular middle axis is rarely reached. Build the rotation with new THREE.Euler(x, y, z, order) using the x/y/z ranges below. Do not decompose with a different order and compare against the ranges.","mirror":"Only left-side and center bones are listed. A right bone is the left bone mirrored across the YZ plane: same order, x range unchanged, y and z ranges become [-max, -min]. (Quaternion form: (qx,-qy,-qz,qw).)","flags":{"randomize":"false = never randomized; \"explicit\" = skipped by group/whole-body randomization, randomized only when the caller asks for that bone explicitly (eyes: both eyes then share one gaze direction); default true","curl":"axis ('z') whose value represents finger curl; random generation shares one curl factor per finger so joints bend together"},"references":["VRoidBones constraints.py (MIT) https://github.com/cmd410/VRoidBones - original numbers, re-derived for the VRM normalized frame","Unity HumanTrait muscle ranges (Front-Back / Left-Right / Twist) - same 3-DOF-per-joint idea","Blender 'Limit Rotation' / Poser joint limits - per-bone Euler box limits with per-bone rotation order","Second Life BVH joint rotation limits; AAOS-style clinical range-of-motion tables"],"bones":{"hips":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-20,20],"motion":"pitch (+: tilt pelvis forward)"},"y":{"range":[-35,35],"motion":"twist (turn about the vertical axis)"},"z":{"range":[-15,15],"motion":"roll (+: lean to character's right)"}},"spine":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-15,30],"motion":"flexion(+)/extension(-)"},"y":{"range":[-20,20],"motion":"twist"},"z":{"range":[-15,15],"motion":"lateral bend (+: to character's right)"}},"chest":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-10,20],"motion":"flexion(+)/extension(-)"},"y":{"range":[-20,20],"motion":"twist"},"z":{"range":[-12,12],"motion":"lateral bend (+: to character's right)"}},"upperChest":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-8,10],"motion":"flexion(+)/extension(-)"},"y":{"range":[-15,15],"motion":"twist"},"z":{"range":[-8,8],"motion":"lateral bend (+: to character's right)"}},"neck":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-25,30],"motion":"flexion(+)/extension(-)"},"y":{"range":[-40,40],"motion":"twist (look left/right)"},"z":{"range":[-20,20],"motion":"lateral bend (+: to character's right)"}},"head":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-25,30],"motion":"flexion(+: nod down)/extension(-: look up)"},"y":{"range":[-40,40],"motion":"twist (look left/right)"},"z":{"range":[-20,20],"motion":"lateral bend (+: to character's right)"}},"jaw":{"order":"ZXY","randomize":false,"x":{"range":[0,20],"motion":"opening(+)"},"y":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"lateral slide"},"z":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"}},"leftEye":{"order":"YXZ","randomize":"explicit","x":{"range":[-25,25],"motion":"pitch (+: look down)"},"y":{"range":[-30,35],"motion":"yaw (+: toward character's left = outward for the left eye)"},"z":{"range":[0,0],"motion":"unused"}},"leftShoulder":{"order":"ZYX","x":{"range":[-10,10],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-20,10],"motion":"protraction(-: forward)/retraction(+: backward)"},"z":{"range":[-10,35],"motion":"depression(-)/elevation(+)"}},"leftUpperArm":{"order":"ZYX","x":{"range":[-90,70],"motion":"twist (+: internal rotation, -: external)"},"y":{"range":[-95,35],"motion":"horizontal swing (-: forward, +: backward)"},"z":{"range":[-85,70],"motion":"elevation in frontal plane (-: down/adduction, +: up/abduction; 0 = T-pose)"}},"leftLowerArm":{"order":"ZYX","x":{"range":[-80,80],"motion":"forearm twist (pronation/supination)"},"y":{"range":[-150,5],"motion":"elbow flexion (-: bends forward)"},"z":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"unused (elbow is a hinge)"}},"leftHand":{"order":"ZYX","x":{"range":[-10,10],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-20,35],"motion":"radial(-: toward thumb)/ulnar(+) deviation"},"z":{"range":[-75,65],"motion":"wrist palmar flexion(-)/dorsiflexion(+)"}},"leftUpperLeg":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-110,25],"motion":"hip flexion(-: leg forward)/extension(+: backward)"},"y":{"range":[-40,45],"motion":"twist (+: external rotation, toe out)"},"z":{"range":[-30,45],"motion":"adduction(-)/abduction(+: leg out)"}},"leftLowerLeg":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[0,150],"motion":"knee flexion (+: shank goes backward)"},"y":{"range":[-15,15],"motion":"twist"},"z":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused (knee is a hinge)"}},"leftFoot":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-25,45],"motion":"dorsiflexion(-: toes up)/plantarflexion(+: toes down)"},"y":{"range":[-20,25],"motion":"toe-in(-)/toe-out(+)"},"z":{"range":[-15,35],"motion":"eversion(-)/inversion(+: sole turns inward)"}},"leftToes":{"order":"ZXY","x":{"range":[-50,35],"motion":"extension(-: up)/flexion(+: curl down)"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"}},"leftIndexProximal":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-8,8],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-20,8],"motion":"spread(-: toward thumb side)"},"z":{"range":[-90,25],"motion":"MCP flexion(-)/hyperextension(+)"}},"leftIndexIntermediate":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-105,0],"motion":"PIP flexion(-)"}},"leftIndexDistal":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-80,5],"motion":"DIP flexion(-)"}},"leftMiddleProximal":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-8,8],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-10,10],"motion":"spread(-: toward thumb side)"},"z":{"range":[-90,25],"motion":"MCP flexion(-)/hyperextension(+)"}},"leftMiddleIntermediate":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-105,0],"motion":"PIP flexion(-)"}},"leftMiddleDistal":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-80,5],"motion":"DIP flexion(-)"}},"leftRingProximal":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-8,8],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-8,12],"motion":"spread(-: toward thumb side)"},"z":{"range":[-90,25],"motion":"MCP flexion(-)/hyperextension(+)"}},"leftRingIntermediate":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-105,0],"motion":"PIP flexion(-)"}},"leftRingDistal":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-80,5],"motion":"DIP flexion(-)"}},"leftLittleProximal":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-8,8],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-8,22],"motion":"spread(-: toward thumb side)"},"z":{"range":[-90,25],"motion":"MCP flexion(-)/hyperextension(+)"}},"leftLittleIntermediate":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-105,0],"motion":"PIP flexion(-)"}},"leftLittleDistal":{"order":"ZYX","curl":"z","x":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"twist"},"y":{"range":[-3,3],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-80,5],"motion":"DIP flexion(-)"}},"leftThumbMetacarpal":{"order":"ZYX","x":{"range":[-10,30],"motion":"flexion(+) toward palm / extension(-)"},"y":{"range":[-20,30],"motion":"palmar abduction(-: forward, away from index)/opposition(+)"},"z":{"range":[-30,10],"motion":"flexion(-) toward palm (coupled with X)"}},"leftThumbProximal":{"order":"ZYX","x":{"range":[-5,40],"motion":"flexion(+)"},"y":{"range":[-10,10],"motion":"abduction"},"z":{"range":[-40,10],"motion":"flexion(-) (coupled with X)"}},"leftThumbDistal":{"order":"ZYX","x":{"range":[-5,30],"motion":"flexion(+)"},"y":{"range":[-5,5],"motion":"unused"},"z":{"range":[-60,5],"motion":"IP flexion(-) (coupled with X)"}}}}